// The total line of the statement in real terms against Outturn (real terms), by financial year: both are the year's
// outturn in 2025-26 prices, so they are the same number. Expected values: the year totals of dw.fact_outturn times the
// year's factor, in both columns.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    "statement_total_real", CALCULATE ( [Statement Amount (real terms)], 'Statement Line'[Line Id] = "TOT" ),
    "outturn_real", [Outturn (real terms)]
)
ORDER BY 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year]
